</b>, the quantum", "docsize": 44822, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Madras High Court", "author": "R Vijayakumar", "authorEncoded": "r-vijayakumar"}, {"tid": 36470452, "catids": [20, 1], "doctype": 1017, "publishdate": "2021-07-12", "authorid": 802, "bench": [802], "title": "M/S Colors Trendz Private Limited vs Deputy Engineer (O And M) on 12 July, 2021", "numcites": 11, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Sec</b>.\n          <b>126</b>  of The <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003.  <b>Sec</b>. <b>126</b>(6)  of The\n          <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 says that <b>electricity</b> can be <b>used</b> ... unauthorizedly extended the power boundary and it\n          amounts to <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Sec</b>.\n          <b>126</b>  and therefore the respondent no.3 was issued\n          provisional", "docsize": 49223, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gujarat High Court", "author": "A J Shastri", "authorEncoded": "a-j-shastri"}, {"tid": 22702264, "catids": null, "doctype": 1006, "publishdate": "2022-02-15", "authorid": 573, "bench": [573], "title": "Sukumar Das vs The West Bengal State <b>Electricity</b> ... on 15 February, 2022", "numcites": 11, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "during which such\n         <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has taken place and if, however,\n         the period during which such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>\n         has taken place ... such person&quot;, sub-<b>section</b> (1) of  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  indicates a\n\n    person who is indulging in <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>.             The <b>electricity</b>\n                                              10 \n\n\n     charges", "docsize": 40542, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Calcutta High Court (Appellete Side)", "author": "S Bhattacharyya", "authorEncoded": "s-bhattacharyya"}, {"tid": 102161888, "catids": [20, 1], "doctype": 1017, "publishdate